do ui.tutorial.set_advisor_expression(Tutorial.STATE.NERV)
I won't take up too much of your time here.
Click to select your units, and click a tile to send them there. They'll attack those they see automatically. This is how you'll manage their safety and volatility.
Send them to houses for them to recover their ranks. Units permanently die if you lose all of them.
Command them to properly defend your colony against the invasion and you should be fine. Good luck!
=> END